==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|tuttugu|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} *''twaintigaz'', {{recons|twai tigiwiz|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''tuttugu''' {{indecl}}

# '''[[twenty]]'''; the cardinal number after [[nítján#Icelandic|nítján]] and before [[tuttugu og einn#Icelandic|tuttugu og einn]].

====Related terms====
* {{sense|ordinal form}} [[tuttugasti]] {{m}}, [[tuttugasta]] {{f|n}}.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|twenty}} [[tvítján]] {{indecl}}

